Value PORT (\S+)
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value MODE (access|trunk|routed)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value ENABLED (yes|no)
Value STATUS (up|down)
Value SPEED (\d+|--)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*?)

Start
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+${VLAN}\s+(?:${MODE}\s+)?${TYPE}\s+${ENABLED}\s+${STATUS}\s+(?:[A-Za-z][A-Za-z ]*?\s+|--\s+)?${SPEED}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
